<div class="container policy-page">
  <h1>Return &amp; Refund Policy</h1>

  <h3>Eligibility for Return</h3>
  <p>We want you to be happy with your purchase. You may request a return within <strong>24 hours</strong> of delivery if:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>The product you received is defective or damaged, or</li>
    <li>You received the wrong product</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We currently do not accept returns for change-of-mind (e.g. wrong size preference, no longer wanted) once an order has been delivered.</p>

  <h3>How to Request a Return</h3>
  <p>Contact us within 24 hours of delivery using the chat button on this site or by calling <%= shopPhone %>, along with your Order ID and a photo of the issue. We'll guide you through the next steps.</p>

  <h3>Resolution</h3>
  <p>Once your returned item is received and inspected, we will decide the appropriate resolution (such as replacement, exchange, or refund) on a case-by-case basis depending on the condition of the product.</p>

  <h3>Non-Returnable Items</h3>
  <p>Items that show signs of use, are missing original packaging, or were not reported within the return window are not eligible for return.</p>
</div>

